msgctxt "64"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "Mmh?"

msgctxt "76"
msgid "What's this doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "What're you doing, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Looks like something washed up on the shore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Hey, you're right! It looks like there's something in that bottle, too... a "
"letter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "(Let's see what it says...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"...It's been six months now, Yasu-kun. Six months since you went off for "
"your fishing expedition and never came back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"The date for our wedding has come and gone. Every day, I stare up at that "
"beautiful wedding gown I was supposed to wear, the one we picked out "
"together..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "I can't go on like this. Not without you, Yasu-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"I'm coming to be with you. Soon, we'll have our happily ever after... even "
"if it's not in this world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "(Oh no...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Wait, is this... a suicide letter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Reads like it, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"I think I've seen this bottle before.... Yeah, I saw one at a store on the "
"corner of Kariyushi Arcade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "You did? If so, I might be able to track down who wrote this letter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Please, could you!? C'mon, you have to! You've got to find her and stop her "
"from killing herself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"You said the Kariyushi Arcade, right? I'll go there and ask them about the "
"bottle."
msgstr ""

